  "instance_name": "misinformation_about_gluten",
  "label": "Misinformation about gluten and gluten-free diets",
  "description": "The widespread belief that gluten is inherently harmful to most people, or that gluten allergies are a recent phenomenon, is a common misconception. This misinformation can lead to unnecessary dietary restrictions and can be harmful to those with genuine medical conditions. The meme plays on this by juxtaposing historical bread consumption with a false claim about a modern health trend.",
